            <LINE ID="P0208.L008" ORDER="8" NO="8" SRC_LINE="14" BBOX="405,1420,2245,1506" CONFIDENCE="97.09">釋道高白：奉垂問至聖顯晦之迹，理味淵</LINE>
            <LINE ID="P0208.L009" ORDER="9" NO="9" SRC_LINE="15" BBOX="280,1550,1734,1638" CONFIDENCE="98.69">博，辭義照洗；敬覽反覆，彌高德音。</LINE>
            <LINE ID="P0208.L010" ORDER="10" NO="10" SRC_LINE="16" BBOX="403,1720,2239,1809" CONFIDENCE="99.14">使君垣墙崇邃，得門自難，輒罄愚管，罔象玄</LINE>
            <LINE ID="P0208.L011" ORDER="11" NO="11" SRC_LINE="17" BBOX="411,2018,2238,2107" CONFIDENCE="98.92">夫如來應物，凡有三焉：一者見身，放光動</LINE>
